sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Cliente / Web UI
    participant API as API service
    participant Controller as TemperatureAverageReportsController
    participant Service as GetTemperatureAverageReportService
    participant StationRepo as IStationRepository / MongoWeatherStationRepository
    participant MeasurementRepo as IMeasurementRepository / MongoMeasurementRepository
    participant Mongo as MongoDB

    Client->>API: GET /stations/:stationId/reports/temperature/daily-average<br/>or /weekly-average
    API->>Controller: route(stationId, period)
    Controller->>Service: execute(stationId, daily|weekly)
    Service->>StationRepo: findById(stationId)
    StationRepo-->>Service: station

    alt Station does not exist
        Service-->>Controller: not found
        Controller-->>Client: 404 station not found
    else Station exists
        Service->>Service: resolve UTC window<br/>24h or 7d ending at now
        Service->>MeasurementRepo: averageTemperatureForPeriod(stationId, from, to)
        MeasurementRepo->>Mongo: aggregate measurements by stationId + reportedAt
        Mongo-->>MeasurementRepo: average value + sample count
        MeasurementRepo-->>Service: TemperatureAverageResult
        Service-->>Controller: station + period + average + sampleCount
        Controller-->>Client: 200 TemperatureAverageReport
    end

    Note over Service,Mongo: This report never calls ingestion or OpenWeather; it uses persisted manual and openweather measurements.
    Note over Controller,Client: Empty periods return 200 with average.value=null and sampleCount=0.
